    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d582">

                <pb facs="0592" n="582" xml:id="pg582"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.93/11–1449</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Acting Secretary of State</hi><anchor
                        n="44" xml:id="d582-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1949-11-14">November 14, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Possible Aid to the Forces Still Opposing the
                        Chinese Communists</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The President handed me the attached undated, unsigned memorandum with respect to
                    possible aid to the forces still opposing the Chinese Communists. He asked that
                    I read this and return it to him.</p>
                <p>As the Secretary will have to discuss this matter with the President when he
                    returns it on his next visit, please prepare an evaluation to form the basis of
                    such discussion.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">James</hi> E. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d582-a1.xml" xpointer="d582-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
